OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain affecting much of southern
OL,7,FEngland and Wales tonight, heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Further north, a few showers
OL,9,Falong North Sea coasts, otherwise
OL,10,Fclear spells allowing frost to develop
OL,11,Fand some mist and fog patches.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FRain in southern England
OL,14,Fand Wales easing through the morning
OL,15,Falbeit remaining cloudy. Drier,
OL,16,Fbrighter and sunnier elsewhere after a
OL,17,Fchilly start. Windy in the far north
OL,18,Fand feeling cold.
